OL,3,GNEWSAYoungest ever MHK says election
OL,4,Awin is 'surreal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who became the youngest ever
OL,7,Fperson to be elected to the House of
OL,8,FKeys has described winning a seat as
OL,9,F"surreal".
OL,11,FDaniel Davison, 18, won a seat in
OL,12,FGlenfaba and Peel on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe House of Keys is the elected
OL,15,Fchamber of the Isle of Man's
OL,16,Fparliament. Its 24 members are known as
OL,17,FMHKs.
OL,19,FDavison said he stood because the
OL,20,Fdecisions made in the next five years
OL,21,Fwill "land on my generation the
OL,22,Fhardest".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
